  "perks": [
    {"key":"alchemy_2","title":"Volatile Concoctions","tree":"Alchemist","slug":"volatile-concoctions","row":1,"column":2,"description":"Increase the effect of utility potions by 5%.","facts":["Every elixir formula in misc.txt counts it as +5% Utility Potion Effectiveness."]},
    {"key":"alchemy_4","title":"Hidden Elixirs","tree":"Alchemist","slug":"hidden-elixirs","row":2,"column":1,"description":"You can find utility potions that don't normally drop.","facts":["Drops only with it: Elixir of the Giant, Elixir of the Feline, Elixir of the Gorilla and Elixir of the Raven (treasure class Utility Elixir Regular Hidden, 4 of 17 in Utility Elixir Regular; without the perk it is left out of the roll).","Drops only with it: Greater Elixir of the Giant, Greater Elixir of the Feline, Greater Elixir of the Gorilla and Greater Elixir of the Raven (treasure class Utility Elixir Greater Hidden, 4 of 17 in Utility Elixir Greater; without the perk it is left out of the roll)."]},
    {"key":"alchemy_5","title":"Unstable Mixtures","tree":"Alchemist","slug":"unstable-mixtures","row":2,"column":2,"description":"Rejuvenation potions have a 15% chance to drop as a random utility potion instead.","facts":["15% of the Rejuv Potion picks become an elixir roll instead (Rejuvenation Regular).","15% of the Full Rejuv Potion picks become an elixir roll instead (Rejuvenation Full).","It works on the rejuvenation potions Find Potion makes too: the alchemy plugin sends them through the same treasure classes."]},
    {"key":"alchemy_6","title":"Bountiful Brews","tree":"Alchemist","slug":"bountiful-brews","row":2,"column":3,"description":"Increase the quantity of potions dropped by 50%.","facts":["With it, the potion rolls (Potion 1 … Potion 8) make 1.5 picks on average instead of 1, so elixirs drop that much more often too."]},
    {"key":"alchemy_8","title":"Gem Infusion","tree":"Alchemist","slug":"gem-infusion","row":3,"column":2,"description":"You can craft a random utility potion by transmuting a perfect gem with a randomizing stone.","facts":["Needed for the cube recipe Randomizing Stone + Perfect Gem → Regular Elixirs or Greater Elixirs."]},
    {"key":"alchemy_9","title":"Compounded Synergy","tree":"Alchemist","slug":"compounded-synergy","row":3,"column":3,"description":"The effect of all potions is increased by 5% for every different potion effect you have active on you.","facts":["Every potion effect is 5% stronger for each different potion effect running on you, itself included (alchemy plugin; not in the values on this page)."]},
    {"key":"alchemy_10","title":"Savvy Elixirs","tree":"Alchemist","slug":"savvy-elixirs","row":4,"column":1,"description":"You have a 25% chance to gain the effects of an utility potion without consuming it.","facts":["25% chance that a utility potion is not used up; its effect still applies (alchemy plugin)."]},
    {"key":"alchemy_12","title":"Alchemical Excellence","tree":"Alchemist","slug":"alchemical-excellence","row":4,"column":3,"description":"Utility potions that drop or that you craft have a 25% chance to become a greater variant instead.","facts":["Drops only with it: the 17 greater elixirs (treasure class Utility Elixir Greater, 1 of 4 in Utility Elixir; without the perk it is left out of the roll).","Needed for the cube recipe Randomizing Stone + Perfect Gem → Greater Elixirs or Regular Elixirs.","With it, 25% of these transmutes give Greater Elixirs (a Randomizing Stone roll of at least 384 of 0 to 511, cubemain line 2309)."]},
    {"key":"alchemy_13","title":"Elixir of Reincarnation","tree":"Alchemist","slug":"elixir-of-reincarnation","row":5,"column":1,"description":"You can craft Elixir of Reincarnation by transmuting 5 Dragon Stones which brings you back to full life and mana on taking fatal damage and granting you a 1 second invincibility. Usage cooldown: 300 seconds.","facts":["Gives the Elixir of Reincarnation; cubemain.txt has no recipe that makes it and no treasure class drops it.","The mod author (2026-11-07): the missing recipe is a bug of 3.3; the next patch adds it, so until then the elixir cannot be had.","On a hit that would kill you it restores full life and mana instead, makes you invulnerable for 1 s, and starts a 300 s cooldown (alchemy plugin)."]},
    {"key":"alchemy_15","title":"Serendipity","tree":"Alchemist","slug":"serendipity","row":5,"column":3,"description":"Your utility potions have a 15% chance to grant you the effect of a random shrine.","facts":["15% chance that a utility potion also gives the effect of one random shrine: Refilling Shrine, Armor Shrine, Combat Shrine, Resist Fire Shrine, Resist Cold Shrine, Resist Lightning Shrine, Resist Poison Shrine, Skill Shrine, Mana Recharge Shrine and Experience Shrine (alchemy plugin)."]}
  ],
